./docs/operations/OPERATOR_GUIDE.md:13:NoemaForge no longer treats autostart as a raw `enable noemaforge-llama@main.service` action. The only supported autostart path is **gated safe-start**:
./docs/operations/OPERATOR_GUIDE.md:19:This preserves the current NoemaForge safety lesson: a heavy Qwen/NoemaForge LLM must not compete with GDM during early boot. The launcher waits for the selected mode and then runs the same memory/runtime checks as `sudo noemaforge safe-start --wait`.
./docs/operations/OPERATOR_GUIDE.md:25:sudo noemaforge boot-mode set manual --apply-systemd
