./noemaforge/docs/history/CHANGELOG.md:2119:- 2026-05-20: Added Systemd Happy Path contract pack `systemd-happy-path-core`: No happy-path install or boot-mode flow requires hand-editing systemd units; `noemaforge boot-mode` / setup wrappers own install-units, dry-run and daemon-reload checks with QA and synthetic performance coverage.
./noemaforge/docs/history/CHANGELOG.md:2134:- 2026-05-20: Added launcher dataset assurance so `/opt/noemaforge/datasets/role_eval_cases` is checked or seeded before firstboot scoring starts, with `dataset-assurance.json` evidence and blocking failure state. Includes QA and synthetic performance coverage.
./noemaforge/docs/history/CHANGELOG.md:2137:- 2026-05-20: Added machine-local defaults via `machine-local-defaults-core` so `/etc/default/noemaforge-recovery`, `/etc/default/noemaforge-runtime` and `/etc/default/noemaforge-firstboot` have non-secret examples (`noemaforge-runtime.example`, `noemaforge-firstboot.example`), optional systemd `EnvironmentFile` hooks and installer if-missing behavior. Includes QA and synthetic performance coverage.
./noemaforge/docs/history/CHANGELOG.md:2138:- 2026-05-20: Optimized repeated `systemd-happy-path-core` validation with an mtime/size-scoped registry cache so its synthetic performance test remains stable as the prelaunch registry grows.
./noemaforge/docs/history/CHANGELOG.md:2139:- 2026-05-20: Added cgroup-aware stop/reboot-safe behavior via `cgroup-aware-stop-core`: stop/service-stop/llm-stop discover systemd `ControlGroup`, drain `cgroup.procs`/`cgroup.threads` before legacy pkill fallback, and reboot-safe audits unit cgroups after stop. Includes QA and synthetic performance coverage.
./noemaforge/docs/history/CHANGELOG.md:2183:- 2026-05-20: Closed the production GUI installer item through `production-gui-installer-core`: setup, the promoted installer, dry-run/root guards, delayed GUI systemd timer, Admin GUI assets, boot-mode CLI and recovery helpers are now validated together offline, with QA and bounded performance coverage. Closed by `production-gui-installer-core`.
./noemaforge/docs/history/CHANGELOG.md:2184:- 2026-05-20: Closed the user-level dashboard autostart item through `dashboard-launcher-core`: `noemaforge dashboard autostart-enable|autostart-disable|autostart-status` now writes operator-scoped systemd user service/timer units under `XDG_CONFIG_HOME`, exposes dry-run planning, avoids root and keeps LLM/media backends manual. Closed by `dashboard-launcher-core`.
./noemaforge/docs/history/CHANGELOG.md:2205:- 2026-05-21: Closed the installed pipeline CLI wiring item through `pipeline-cli-install-wiring-core`: `/usr/local/bin/noemaforge` is now covered as a dry-run-visible symlink to `/opt/noemaforge/bin/noemaforge`, setup selftest parses the packaged CLI, the CLI keeps canonical self guards and the installed entrypoint exposes the pipeline command surface. Includes offline runtime, QA and bounded performance coverage. Closed by `pipeline-cli-install-wiring-core`.
./noemaforge/docs/history/CHANGELOG.md:2213:- 2026-05-21: Added `emergency-gui-recovery-readiness-core` for the still-open Debian Trixie emergency GUI recovery validation: the task remains `blocked_until_target_emergency_gui_recovery_evidence`, while local QA now validates display-manager/GDM baseline, operator-approved `pause --wait` and `gui-rescue --wait`, display-manager alias evidence, post-rescue `/run/nologin` guard, forensics archive, registry attachment and documentation trace without executing systemd or recovery commands.
./noemaforge/docs/history/CHANGELOG.md:2214:- 2026-05-21: Added `post-reboot-service-health-readiness-core` for the still-open target-machine post-reboot health confirmation of `noemaforge-llama@main`, gateway and ToolProxy: the task remains `blocked_until_target_post_reboot_service_health_evidence`, while local QA now validates boot baseline, gateway service state, operator-approved manual main-backend start/stop, ToolProxy service state, socket/API smoke output, archive evidence, registry attachment and documentation trace without executing systemd, socket or LLM commands.
./noemaforge/docs/history/CHANGELOG.md:2215:- 2026-05-21: Added `trixie-preflight-target-readiness-core` for the still-open target-machine `sudo noemaforge trixie-preflight --json` item: the task remains `blocked_until_target_trixie_preflight_evidence`, while local QA now validates operator-approved read-only preflight JSON, Debian/kernel baseline, dependency surface, runtime socket snapshot, archive evidence, registry attachment and documentation trace without executing sudo, preflight, systemd, socket or remediation commands.
./noemaforge/docs/history/CHANGELOG.md:2216:- 2026-05-21: Added `failure-forensics-bundle-readiness-core` for the still-open target-machine `sudo noemaforge forensics` after-failure item: the task remains `blocked_until_target_failure_forensics_bundle_evidence`, while local QA now validates failure context, operator-approved forensics transcripts, bundle integrity, redaction review, runtime log coverage, inspection follow-up, registry attachment and documentation trace without executing sudo, forensics, journal, systemd or upload commands.
./noemaforge/docs/history/CHANGELOG.md:2217:- 2026-05-21: Added `target-gui-recovery-path-readiness-core` for the still-open target-hardware `pause --wait` then `gui-rescue --wait` item: the task remains `blocked_until_target_gui_recovery_path_evidence`, while local QA now validates display/GDM baseline, operator-approved pause and GUI rescue transcripts, post-rescue display and `/run/nologin` state, forensics archive, inspection follow-up, registry attachment and documentation trace without executing sudo, recovery, systemd or archive commands.
./noemaforge/docs/history/CHANGELOG.md:2218:- 2026-05-21: Added `toolproxy-capability-live-smoke-readiness-core` for the still-open target-machine ToolProxy capability issue/verify smoke item: the task remains `blocked_until_target_toolproxy_capability_live_smoke_evidence`, while local QA now validates ToolProxy baseline, operator approval, live capability issue, live verify, token redaction/revocation, archive evidence, registry attachment and documentation trace without executing ToolProxy, systemd, socket or archive commands.
./noemaforge/docs/history/CHANGELOG.md:2219:- 2026-05-21: Added `gateway-main-live-smoke-readiness-core` for the still-open target-machine gateway plus `noemaforge-llama@main` smoke item: the task remains `blocked_until_target_gateway_main_live_smoke_evidence`, while local QA now validates service baseline, operator approval, manual main-backend start, gateway socket/status, gateway smoke/chat, stop/archive evidence, registry attachment and documentation trace without executing systemd, gateway, socket or LLM commands.
./noemaforge/docs/history/CHANGELOG.md:2220:- 2026-05-21: Added `systemd-gdm-nvidia-live-validation-readiness-core` for the still-open target-machine systemd/GDM/NVIDIA validation item: the task remains `blocked_until_target_systemd_gdm_nvidia_live_validation_evidence`, while local QA now validates boot/systemd baseline, operator approval, display-manager/GDM state, NVIDIA driver/device signal, secure-boot/kernel logs, recovery guards, archive evidence, registry attachment and documentation trace without executing systemd, GDM, NVIDIA, journal, loginctl or archive commands.
./noemaforge/docs/history/CHANGELOG.md:2221:- 2026-05-21: Added `toolproxy-live-llm-smoke-readiness-core` for the still-open target-machine ToolProxy socket plus `llm.chat` smoke item: the task remains `blocked_until_target_toolproxy_live_llm_smoke_evidence`, while local QA now validates ToolProxy socket baseline, operator approval, `llm.chat` capability binding, live smoke JSON, token revocation, archive evidence, registry attachment and documentation trace without executing ToolProxy, systemd, socket or LLM commands.
./noemaforge/docs/history/CHANGELOG.md:2222:- 2026-05-21: Added `post-reboot-gpu-gdm-gateway-toolproxy-readiness-core` for the still-open target-machine post-reboot GPU/GDM/gateway/ToolProxy validation item: the task remains `blocked_until_target_post_reboot_gpu_gdm_gateway_toolproxy_evidence`, while local QA now validates boot baseline, operator approval, GPU/GDM state, gateway and ToolProxy service state, gateway and ToolProxy socket smoke evidence, archive hash, redaction review, registry attachment and documentation trace without executing systemd, NVIDIA, gateway, ToolProxy, LLM or archive commands.
